[Details]
Name=PA Skills Portable
AppID=PASkillsPortable
Publisher=Harshal
Homepage=https://github.com/harshalambani/platform-agnostic-skills-portable
Category=Office
; Describes what is in the box TODAY, which is why it names a domain the
; architecture itself does not: the skill registry is generic, and the shipped
; skills merely all happen to be accounting and tax ones. Broaden this line when
; that stops being true -- it is the only place that needs it. The splash
; (bundling/icons/make_splash.py) deliberately makes the general claim instead,
; so it never goes stale.
; Note "any LLM" rather than "offline": the active endpoint can be a cloud one.
Description=Platform-agnostic accounting and tax skills, powered by any LLM - local, LAN or cloud. No install; runs from a folder.
